摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"为 DSH Web UI 增加跨平台文件拖拽与原始路径插入能力，无需复制文件","id":"gh:1324718909","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-drag-and-drop","slug":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"为 DSH Web UI 增加跨平台文件拖拽与原始路径插入能力，无需复制文件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-drag-and-drop — Drag local files in and insert their real paths"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Install:** `dsh plugin --profile web add github:omdsh-dev/dsh-drag-and-drop`"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**A DeepSeek Harness Web UI plugin: drag local files or folders onto any part of the page and their "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"original absolute filesystem paths are inserted into the current conversation input — without upload"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ing, moving, or copying anything.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"A browser never hands a web page the real filesystem path of a dropped file — it exposes only a loca"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"l file URI when it feels like it, and often nothing at all, for security. DSH, though, operates on r"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"eal files: its tools read, run, and patch actual paths on the machine. Drop a file into an ordinary "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"web input and you get either an upload (a copy that silently breaks the file's relationship with its"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" neighboring dependencies) or a hand-typed path that is easy to get wrong."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"This plugin closes that gap on the machine running DSH. It converts the browser's local file URI int"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"o the native absolute path, and when the browser hides the path entirely it resolves the file back t"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"o its real location — through the current Workspace, registered Workspaces, the OS file index, and a"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" bounded directory search — then writes that path into the current conversation input. The file neve"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"r leaves its directory."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Drag files onto any part of the Web UI to insert their original absolute paths\n- Full-page dim + b"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"lur hint while dragging\n- Supports files and folders; drag multiple items at once — one path per lin"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"e\n- Native paths on macOS, Linux, and Windows\n- POSIX paths, Windows drive-letter paths, and UNC net"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"work paths\n- No uploading, moving, or copying of files\n- Locates files in the current Workspace and "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"registered Workspaces first\n- When the browser hides the original path, uses the local file index an"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"d bounded directory search\n- Computes content fingerprints only when multiple candidates exist\n- Whe"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"n several byte-identical copies cannot be told apart automatically, lets the user pick the path\n- Fa"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"iled lookups surface as a dismissible plugin toast (auto-dismisses after 8s; hovering pauses the tim"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"er)\n- Writes the draft via DSH's input-state service instead of touching the input DOM"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Drag files or folders from Finder, a Linux file manager, or Windows Explorer onto any part of the DS"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"s or folders from Finder, a Linux file manager, or Windows Explorer onto any part of the DSH Web UI."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Release the mouse when the full-page drag hint appears; the plugin writes the resolved original abso"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"lute path into the current conversation input."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Dropping multiple items at once inserts one path per line."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The plugin is a DSH **bundle** (`package.json` declares `dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client`). Install it int"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"o the `web` profile with the standard `dsh plugin` mechanism — **no DSH source changes and no `confi"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"le with the standard `dsh plugin` mechanism — **no DSH source changes and no `config.yaml` needed**:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The repository ships its build output (`lib/` is committed) — no build step needed after installing."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> The old README's `pnpm --filter @deepseek-ai/dsh add ...` + `config.yaml` flow is obsolete: under "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"the official profile/bundle model `config.yaml` is no longer read."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"After installing, **restart the Web UI** the way you normally start DSH, then refresh the browser pa"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ge — the plugin appears in the browser boot manifest (`__DSH_BOOT__`) and its client bundle loads au"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"gin appears in the browser boot manifest (`__DSH_BOOT__`) and its client bundle loads automatically."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Upgrade"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"For a local-path installation, run `add` again against the replacement checkout."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The command removes the package from the profile and from `dsh.profile.bundles`. After uninstalling,"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" restart the Web UI and hard-refresh the browser."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Symptom | Resolution |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Dropping a file inserts nothing | Drag again and confirm the full-page hint appears. Verify the bu"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ndle is in the profile (`dsh --profile web --dump-config | grep drag-and-drop`) and that the Web UI "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"was restarted + hard-refreshed after installing |\n| Wrong path inserted when several copies share a "},{"id":"p29s4","text":"name | Candidates are filtered by full file name and size, then content-sampled only among the survi"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"vors. If byte-identical copies remain, the plugin shows a chooser — pick the correct path there |\n| "},{"id":"p29s6","text":"Path resolution is slow on a large disk | Install the platform index (Linux: `plocate`; Windows: Eve"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"rything CLI) and keep files inside a Workspace or a common directory. Every search is bounded: 3s pe"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"r index command, at most 100 candidates, at most 20,000 directory entries per root |\n| macOS/Linux: "},{"id":"p29s9","text":"dropping a folder resolves nothing | Folders are matched by name against Workspaces and common direc"},{"id":"p29s10","text":"tories; a folder outside every searchable root cannot be located when the browser hides the path — m"},{"id":"p29s11","text":"ove it into a Workspace or install the OS index |\n| Plugin does not load after install | Restart the"},{"id":"p29s12","text":" Web UI and hard-refresh the browser — the client bundle only loads on a fresh page load with the pl"},{"id":"p29s13","text":"ugin in `__DSH_BOOT__` |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Path resolution"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"If the browser exposes a local file URI, the plugin converts it directly into the operating system's"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"r exposes a local file URI, the plugin converts it directly into the operating system's native path."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"If the browser hides the original path for security reasons, the plugin locates the file in this ord"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"the browser hides the original path for security reasons, the plugin locates the file in this order:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"1. The current Workspace\n2. Other registered Workspaces\n3. Desktop, Documents, and Downloads\n[该节后续省略"},{"id":"p33s2","text":". The current Workspace\n2. Other registered Workspaces\n3. Desktop, Documents, and Downloads\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Privacy & file access"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The plugin never:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- uploads files\n- copies files\n- moves files\n- modifies files\n- deletes files"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"In most cases the plugin only reads file metadata."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Only when multiple candidates share the same name and size does it read a small amount of content to"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" compute sampled fingerprints, and only when large files cannot be told apart by sampling does it re"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ad the full content to compute SHA-256."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"All resolution and fingerprinting happens locally on the machine running DSH."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
